WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.613
Here is how to install Frog Bot on Windows. It takes about two minutes, and you do not need any technical skills.

00:00:09.013 --> 00:00:17.837
Open your browser and go to sayeemkabir dot github dot io slash frogbot. Click the green Download for Windows button.

00:00:18.237 --> 00:00:32.464
Open the file you downloaded. If Windows says it protected your PC, that is normal for new apps. Click More info, then Run anyway. Frog Bot installs and opens by itself.

00:00:32.864 --> 00:00:39.533
Frog Bot opens on the sign in screen. The first time, click Create an account.

00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:50.125
Enter your name, your email, and a password of at least six characters. Then click Create account. Your team is private to your account.

00:00:50.525 --> 00:00:59.579
Next, paste your Claude or OpenAI API key, and click Start. Your key stays encrypted on your own computer.

00:00:59.979 --> 00:01:10.497
This is your team. Frog is your lead agent. Say hi, and tell it what you need, in plain words, like you would tell a coworker.

00:01:10.897 --> 00:01:21.320
Your name shows at the bottom left. Click it any time to change your picture, or to sign out. That is it. You are ready to go.

00:01:21.731 --> 00:01:34.283
One last thing. Closing the window keeps Frog Bot running in the tray, so your agents can keep working. To close it fully, right click the frog in the tray and choose Quit.
